                          <li>Recharge at scenic Mekong Restop on the way to the Delta</li>
                          <li>Marvel at the 170-year-old architectural synthesis of Vinh Trang Pagoda</li>
                          <li>Cruise Tien River to Thoi Son Islet & enjoy an unhurried orchard lunch</li>
                          <li>Check in 3-star Can Tho hotel and soak in the evening breeze of Ninh Kieu Wharf</li>
                        </ul>
                      </div>

                      <p style="margin-bottom:14px"><strong>08:00 AM — Departure from Saigon:</strong> The journey begins as your private air-conditioned 7-seater van leaves downtown Saigon. Enjoy a relaxing drive south through the lush scenery of Long An and Tien Giang provinces.</p>
                      
                      <p style="margin-bottom:14px"><strong>09:15 AM — Refreshment at Mekong Restop:</strong> Make a brief refreshment stop at the peaceful garden setting of Mekong Restop — the perfect place to recharge before stepping into the authentic rhythm of river life.</p>
                      
                      <p style="margin-bottom:14px"><strong>10:00 AM — Explore Vinh Trang Pagoda:</strong> Visit the 170-year-old Vinh Trang Pagoda in My Tho. Marvel at the unique architectural synthesis where Asian Buddhist serenity meets European Renaissance and Roman motifs in a way found nowhere else in the Delta.</p>
                      
                      <p style="margin-bottom:14px"><strong>11:00 AM — Wooden Boat to Thoi Son Islet:</strong> Board a private traditional wooden boat to cruise across the expansive Tien River towards Thoi Son Island. Walk beneath lush fruit trees, sip fresh honey tea, and savor a peaceful, authentic Southern Vietnamese lunch prepared with fresh local river specialties.</p>

                      <p style="margin-bottom:14px"><strong>02:30 PM — Scenic Transfer to Can Tho:</strong> Re-board your private van and continue your journey to Can Tho — the vibrant heart of the Western Mekong Delta. Arrive around 04:30 PM, check in to your 3-star hotel, and relax.</p>

                      <p style="margin-bottom:14px"><strong>06:30 PM — Ninh Kieu Wharf & Can Tho Evening:</strong> Stroll along the pedestrian bridge at Ninh Kieu Wharf, take in the cool breeze over the Hau River, and enjoy a flavorful dinner featuring Can Tho specialties before turning in for an early rest in preparation for tomorrow's dawn sunrise.</p>
                    </div>
                  </details>

                  <!-- DAY 2 -->
